            "value" : "Home shows up to the %lld most recently recorded entries. Find earlier ones in the calendar (swipe left) by day, in the category lists of the Monthly Summary, or under Export Entries in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ホームの入力欄から「ランチ 850」のように送ると、ここに何にいくら使ったかが出ます。" : {
