        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A category with this name already exists."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ言葉の記録を、次からこのカテゴリで記録します。前に記録したものは変わりません。忘れても、同じ言葉の記録がたまっていれば、その記録でいつも使うカテゴリで記録します。覚えた言葉は記録と同じ場所（この iPhone、iCloud で同期しているときはあなたの iCloud）に保存し、外へ送りません。" : {
      "comment" : "設定の「覚えたカテゴリ」の一覧の注記",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entries with the same words are recorded in these categories from now on. Earlier entries don’t change. Even after you forget a word, if you’ve recorded it several times, it goes to the category you usually use for it. Learned words are stored with your records (on this iPhone, and in your iCloud when sync is on) and are never sent anywhere else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
