      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SaifuLog records them the first time you open the app on or after the day, and tells you in a reply on Home. If you undo it, that month isn’t recorded again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "記録する日を過ぎて、最初にアプリを開いたときに記録します。" : {
      "comment" : "くり返しの記録を作る・直すシートの説明",
